[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16502.15, "timestamp": "04:35:02", "text": "今天21岁，伙计。下一个是22号。是的。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16505.269, "timestamp": "04:35:05", "text": "今天是星期天。是的。因为我忘了我们仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16507.269, "timestamp": "04:35:07", "text": "还有八天左右就能完成了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16509.67, "timestamp": "04:35:09", "text": "整个月。所以，没问题。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16511.91, "timestamp": "04:35:11", "text": "还要再受八七天的折磨"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16513.429, "timestamp": "04:35:13", "text": "恐怖。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16515.189, "timestamp": "04:35:15", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16517.75, "timestamp": "04:35:17", "text": "所以，即使你没看到任何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16520.551, "timestamp": "04:35:20", "text": "恐怖的是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16523.109, "timestamp": "04:35:23", "text": "呃，是啊，我觉得我们有点吓到你了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16526.551, "timestamp": "04:35:26", "text": "就像Fasmo那样，但我们做不到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16530.15, "timestamp": "04:35:30", "text": "虽然会像吞噬一样做任何事。嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16531.75, "timestamp": "04:35:31", "text": "即使你死了两次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16533.59, "timestamp": "04:35:33", "text": "你也喜欢并习惯了跳跃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16536.789, "timestamp": "04:35:36", "text": "也很吓人。所以，就像我一样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16538.109, "timestamp": "04:35:38", "text": "它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16543.83, "timestamp": "04:35:43", "text": "美好的。你又想起了什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16547.269, "timestamp": "04:35:47", "text": "就像玩 FPS 版的《Fasmophobia》一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16550.869, "timestamp": "04:35:50", "text": "你必须喜欢扮演开发者的角色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16552.629, "timestamp": "04:35:52", "text": "这是第一人称射击游戏，因为你必须到处跑。"}]